## Who We Serve

### Primary: Domain Investors (Domainers)
People and teams who control domains and domain traffic and want to maximize revenue responsibly across modern monetization paths.

### Secondary: Traffic Buyers
Affiliate buyers/programs and direct traffic buyers who want compliant access to domain traffic supply.

